Odoo mein Widgets ka use fields ko user interface (UI) par different ways mein display karne ke liye hota hai.

Simple words mein:

Widget decides how a field looks and behaves on the screen.

For example, normally a Boolean field displays as a checkbox. But using a widget, we can display it as a toggle switch.
1. Why do we use widgets?
Suppose you have a Student Management module and these fields:
- Student Name
- Student Photo
- Gender
- Active Status
- Rating
You can customize how these fields appear using widgets.
2. Commonly used Odoo widgets
1. Boolean Toggle
Displays a Boolean field as an ON/OFF switch instead of a checkbox.
widget="boolean_toggle"
2. Many2many Tags

Displays multiple related records as tags.

widget="many2many_tags"